{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1196","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D1. RGB Substring (easy version)"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only difference between easy and hard versions is the size of the input"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a string $$$s$$$ consisting of $$$n$$$ characters, each character is '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"R"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' or '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are also given an integer $$$k$$$. Your task is to change the minimum number of characters in the initial string $$$s$$$ so that after the changes there will be a string of length $$$k$$$ that is a substring of $$$s$$$, and is also a substring of the infinite string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"RGBRGBRGB ..."}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A string $$$a$$$ is a substring of string $$$b$$$ if there exists a positive integer $$$i$$$ such that $$$a_1 = b_i$$$, $$$a_2 = b_{i + 1}$$$, $$$a_3 = b_{i + 2}$$$, ..., $$$a_{|a|} = b_{i + |a| - 1}$$$. For example, strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"GBRG"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BR"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are substrings of the infinite string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"RGBRGBRGB ..."}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" while \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"GR"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"RGR"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"GGG"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are not."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to answer $$$q$$$ independent queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains one integer $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le q \\le 2000$$$) — the number of queries. Then $$$q$$$ queries follow."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the query contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\le k \\le n \\le 2000$$$) — the length of the string $$$s$$$ and the length of the substring."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of the query contains a string $$$s$$$ consisting of $$$n$$$ characters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"R"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all queries does not exceed $$$2000$$$ ($$$\\sum n \\le 2000$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query print one integer — the minimum number of characters you need to change in the initial string $$$s$$$ so that after changing there will be a substring of length $$$k$$$ in $$$s$$$ that is also a substring of the infinite string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"RGBRGBRGB ..."}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n5 2\nBGGGG\n5 3\nRBRGR\n5 5\nBBBRR\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n0\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, you can change the first character to '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"R"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and obtain the substring \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"RG"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", or change the second character to '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"R"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and obtain \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BR"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", or change the third, fourth or fifth character to '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and obtain \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"GB"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, the substring is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BRG"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D1","problemCode":"1196D1","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1196/problem/D1"}